  "description": "Ha-Eun writes romance stories but has never created anything too explicit. When she finally does, her publisher ruthlessly rejects it for being too unrealistic! While venting to her childhood friend Si-Woo, Ha-Eun wonders if she should date around for inspiration, causing him to cry and confess to her. They end up at a motel, where Ha-Eun suggests being friends with benefits when Si-Woo clearly wants more. Can he win her over, or will Ha-Eun's need for sexy source material alienate her closest friend?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
